findings.claim:
CONFORMANT: the pre-registration has every section 2.4 item. I checked these against the tracked R2b tables:
- the arms and criterion/selection rule;
- the v2.1 definition and the G-P rule;
- the pass rule and the seed block;
- the A_peak50 paired differences: q50 -0.023458 [-0.041448, -0.003759] and q60 -0.011759 [-0.022732, -0.001032];
- the three violating runs' tail means: 0.020385, 0.021195, 0.022142, with baselines 0.009227, 0.010278, 0.008632;
- the pathwise and censored outcomes;
- the bootstrap seeds 20261005 (pilot), 20261002 (confirmation) and 20261004 (the R2b validation).
The tail-share arithmetic (0.5000 and 0.4545 baseline; 0.2778 and 0.2500 at s=0.5) is also correct.
